WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:05.100
Every new SAM.gov posting is read and matched to your company overnight.

2
00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:09.700
Each one gets a fit score you can trace — NAICS, set-aside, past work, distance.

3
00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:14.700
You get one decision, not a research project. Pursue or pass.

4
00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:19.300
The work splits itself: what already ran, and the short list that needs a person.

5
00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:23.900
Local trades are found, ranked, and contacted before you sit down.

6
00:00:24.220 --> 00:00:28.900
Emails and follow-ups send themselves. Silence becomes a call with a script ready.

7
00:00:29.220 --> 00:00:33.900
Quotes are captured from replies and totalled as they arrive.

8
00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:38.500
No trade is forgotten. The bid is not submittable until coverage is complete.

9
00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:43.300
Pricing, certifications, and all 18 compliance items assemble on their own.

10
00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:48.100
Nothing reaches the agency without you. You review, you send.

11
00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:53.100
Open Today and the rest already ran. Only your decisions are left.
